{"id":"vod_sn_37002","vodId":"37002","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"田中君总是如此慵懒","name_cn":"田中君总是如此慵懒","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4b5426968dd7e313bfce2c61e2a82147.jpg"},"summary":"田中（小野贤章 配音）是1-F班的学生，身体孱弱的他长着一副宛如女孩子般的秀气面孔，讲起话来亦细声细语，还常常讲到一半就因为体力不支而睡着。无论何时，田中都是一副迷迷糊糊的困倦模样，生活中任何麻烦的事情都和他无缘。　　长相有些凶恶的太田（细谷佳正 配音）常常被人误认为是不良少年，但实际上，他却担任着田中身边“保姆”的职责，在生活之中对他照顾有加并且乐在其中。活泼开朗的元气少女宫野（高森奈津美 配音）一直暗恋着大姐头越前（诹访彩花 配音），为了能够成为和越前相配的同伴，宫野拜了田中为师，向他学习稳重慵懒之道。充满了欢乐的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/76skGCB0v01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JU68vsguzV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N7kChCz9TV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iTZRsRWhHL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g45pQzhYc81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KLRUUJbPaU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/05awwKX1af1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DXXjad1aQS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jVW1U07fVS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/udBLFTMMUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYTBxkZUUQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nQ0QMpVbWA1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.126Z"}